@Inventory_Management_dotnet_HostAddress = http://localhost:5142

# Auth reads the JWT from the access_token cookie. The cookie is Secure, so most clients
# won't send it back over http. Requests below send it explicitly from the log-in response.
# Run "log-in" first. Requests that depend on it are marked "requires: log-in".

### Sign up (default role: Staff)
POST {{Inventory_Management_dotnet_HostAddress}}/api/auth/sign-up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "age": 25,
  "gender": "male"
}

###
# @name login
POST {{Inventory_Management_dotnet_HostAddress}}/api/auth/log-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

###
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.$.refresh_token}}

### Refresh tokens (rotates the refresh token)
POST {{Inventory_Management_dotnet_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### List products (anonymous)
GET {{Inventory_Management_dotnet_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=10&sortBy=price
Accept: application/json

### Get product by id (anonymous)
GET {{Inventory_Management_dotnet_HostAddress}}/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Place order (requires: log-in). Expect 201 + Location: /api/orders/{id}
# @name placeOrder
POST {{Inventory_Management_dotnet_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{accessToken}}

{
  "deliveryAddress": "221B Baker Street, London",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Get order by id (requires: log-in). Owner or Admin, anyone else gets 404
GET {{Inventory_Management_dotnet_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{placeOrder.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{accessToken}}

### List orders (requires: log-in). Admin sees all orders, others only their own
GET {{Inventory_Management_dotnet_HostAddress}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=10&status=Pending&sortBy=createdAt&sortDescending=true
Accept: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{accessToken}}

### List orders with invalid page size. Expect 400
GET {{Inventory_Management_dotnet_HostAddress}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=500
Accept: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{accessToken}}

### List orders without a token. Expect 401
GET {{Inventory_Management_dotnet_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json

### Get user by id (requires: log-in, Admin or Staff)
GET {{Inventory_Management_dotnet_HostAddress}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{accessToken}}

### List users (requires: log-in, Admin)
GET {{Inventory_Management_dotnet_HostAddress}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{accessToken}}
